# =========================================================
# IMPORTANT
# =========================================================

# Do NOT ignore all *.dll files.
# The compiled plugin DLL inside the addon folder should be
# committed so users can clone the repository and run it.
#
# Example files that should remain tracked:
#
# addons/native_click_through/bin/windows/*.dll
#
# If your template currently outputs DLLs into another folder,
# keep that release/debug output tracked until the repository
# structure is reorganized.